sequenceDiagram
 participant UI as Web API helper
 participant E as Express
 participant A as requireAuth
 participant R as Route handler
 participant S as Domain / repository
 participant D as PostgreSQL
 participant C as Redis
 UI->>E: JSON request + cookie
 E->>E: CORS, auth routing, JSON parse
 E->>A: protected route
 A->>D: session lookup via auth
 D-->>A: user identity
 A->>R: req.userId set
 R->>S: validate, authorize, execute
 S->>D: repository query/transaction
 S->>C: live state if required
 D-->>S: result
 C-->>S: live result
 S-->>R: domain result
 R-->>UI: JSON response/status
